<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Data Structures Comparison</title>
<style>
body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f4f0ff;color:#30274b;margin:0;padding:24px}
header{text-align:center;background:#694bc2;color:white;padding:28px;border-radius:18px}
main{max-width:900px;margin:25px auto}
.card{background:white;padding:20px;margin:15px 0;border-radius:14px;border-left:6px solid #8969df}
h2{color:#694bc2}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:white}
th,td{padding:12px;border:1px solid #e3dcf4;text-align:left}
th{background:#e9e1ff}
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><h1>🧩 Data Structures Comparison</h1><p>Choose the right way to organize data.</p></header>
<main>
<section class="card"><h2>Array</h2><p>Stores elements in an indexed sequence. Useful for quick access by index.</p></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Linked List</h2><p>Stores elements in nodes connected through links. Insertions can be convenient when the correct node is already located.</p></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Stack</h2><p>Follows LIFO: Last In, First Out. Example: an undo history.</p></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Queue</h2><p>Typically follows FIFO: First In, First Out. Example: a print queue.</p></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Tree</h2><p>Organizes data hierarchically using parent-child relationships.</p></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Hash Table</h2><p>Uses keys to organize values and often supports fast average-case lookups.</p></section>
<h2>Quick Comparison</h2>
<div class="table-wrap">
<table>
<tr><th>Structure</th><th>Organization</th><th>Common Use</th></tr>
<tr><td>Array</td><td>Indexed sequence</td><td>Lists of values</td></tr>
<tr><td>Linked List</td><td>Connected nodes</td><td>Dynamic sequences</td></tr>
<tr><td>Stack</td><td>LIFO</td><td>Undo operations</td></tr>
<tr><td>Queue</td><td>FIFO</td><td>Task scheduling</td></tr>
<tr><td>Tree</td><td>Hierarchy</td><td>File structures</td></tr>
<tr><td>Hash Table</td><td>Key-value pairs</td><td>Fast lookups</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
